"\n"
"    Select the payment method you will use to file your form:\n"
"    - Electronic Funds Withdrawal (EFW)\n"
"    - Electronic Federal Tax Payment System (EFTPS)\n"
"    - Check or Money order\n"
"    - Credit Card"
